@@ -0,0 +1,70 @@
+# sui-code v0.5.4 implementation and acceptance ledger
+
+Baseline: `862cbae35d14954cb87eb03097c0d9dddf5c38ac`, branch `sui-code/v0.5.4-ide-reliability-management`. This is an in-progress ledger, not a completed acceptance report. No new APK has been delivered.
+
+## Implemented so far
+
+- `136a6de`: shared `NativeTaskPaths` / `RuntimeMounts`; carry actual project mounts; stable paths shared with protocol clients; host and guest directory access checks before PTY creation. Stage all authenticated recipe resources, including script siblings. Preserve build outputs and existing task-owner stop/transcript semantics.
+- Native environment configuration uses same-parent rename, retained backups and rollback. No hard links. Broken configuration symlinks can be replaced; unreadable files and directories fail without destroying contents. Existing verified compilers/custom selections reused without apt. GCC/G++ runtime no longer owns GDB/CMake/Ninja; Python runtime no longer owns pip/venv.
+- Follow-up in progress: PRoot host-colon bind aliases; LSP shares VM's project-root resolver and context mounts; serialized didOpen/didChange; disconnect/malformed protocol no longer silently stays Ready; bounded logs/request errors and explicit restart API; localization-only package changes do not restart language services.
+
+## Current progress (continued)
+
+- `822f1c0`: shared path registry and alias mounts for shell/CMake/JVM delimiter paths; LSP document synchronization/lifecycle/error/log/restart changes. Real Ubuntu acceptance now passes 37 task cases, 6 strict LSP project cases, all three DAP flows and 3 actual Core Stop/PTY cases. Six actual PRoot configuration repairs/errors/rollback cases pass without apt. JDT-only / Java Debug-only / Maven-only deployment and injected Maven commit rollback pass. Evidence is Linux x64, not ARM64.
+- Runtime-only Languages rewrite; fixed independent search; existing JDK/native environment detail managers reused. Package/IDE logs removed from Languages.
+- Core card parser/validator + DAG selection, API4-compatible optional metadata, common renderer for catalog/local/third-party cards, fixed language slots, signed directory with explicitly unsigned standalone Chinese card, per-component reviewed deployment/repair/update and runtime read-only ownership. Versioned docs, schemas and three real card packages updated. Log archive separates environment and IDE task histories.
+- Original 732 Chinese values are preserved; current independent Chinese1.0.1 catalog has781 keys. Formal icon asset imported without changing its bytes; mechanical transparent adaptive foreground generated and all launcher channels share it.
+- Latest successful integration compile has187 JVM tests passing. Subsequent selected-update/log tests and Android UI tests are being finalized. Android16 fresh/upgrade/search/card/locale/icon tests and actual downloadable final APK are still pending. Do not treat a checkbox below as a completed ARM64 acceptance result.
+
+## Evidence available (not ARM64 acceptance)
+
+- `/workspace/setup/v054-p0-first.log`: distro/native-packages tests and app Kotlin compilation passed.
+- `/workspace/setup/v054-resources-test2.log`: authenticated sibling resource regression passed.
+- `/workspace/setup/v054-env-rollback.log`: unreadable/dangling/directory/custom selection/rollback regressions passed.
+- `/workspace/setup/v054-lsp-path-tests2.log`: 3 LSP protocol/lifecycle tests and 6 runtime-path tests passed; app compile failed on missing `isActive` import, corrected.
+- `/workspace/setup/v054-lsp-app-compile.log`: corrected production Kotlin compilation passed.
+- Isolated Docker `sui-v054-integration`, real Ubuntu24.04 amd64, JDK27 mounted `/jdk`, GCC/G++, CMake/Ninja, clangd18, LLDB18, pylsp/debugpy/pytest/proot installed. Eclipse JDT LS1.63, Java Debug0.53.1, Maven3.9.11 downloaded and checksum verified. Evidence under `/workspace/artifacts/sui-code-v0.5.4/evidence/`. No real user Ubuntu modified.
+- Existing external official package key matches the existing trust root (public SHA256 `4f95c4008a1bf1c3c1b538b4f4f2e8a2026be8957d9cf6e01ea0beb9e114a1ef`); do not publish private key or change trust root. APK signer must remain v0.5.3 signer.
+
+## Mandatory final acceptance (all retained; pending unless explicitly verified later)
+
+| Item | Implementation / evidence | Status |
+|---|---|---|
+| Java Build/Test/Run | Shared task paths; actual Maven executions pending | pending |
+| C/C++ Build/Test/Run | Mount + authenticated sibling fix; actual CMake/CTest pending | pending |
+| Python Build/Test/Run | Shared task paths; actual executions pending | pending |
+| Project path mounts | RuntimePaths, ProotManager, controller, guest preflight; 6 path tests | automated core passed; Android runtime pending |
+| c.env safe repair | NativeEnvironment; actual filesystem regressions and rollback | core tests passed; PRoot integration pending |
+| GCC/G++ detection | Separate environment discovery/config diagnostics pending | partial |
+| Java completion | LSP transport/root fixes; real JDT LS features pending | pending |
+| C/C++ completion | LSP root fixes; compile DB/features pending | pending |
+| Python completion regression | Real pylsp pending | pending |
+| Debug breakpoint regression | Actual Java/LLDB/debugpy pending | pending |
+| Languages runtime-only | Dedicated runtime management rewrite pending | pending |
+| IDE management in Packages | Unified Kit component cards pending | pending |
+| Selective component installation | Graph/plan/review/coordinator pending | pending |
+| Separate log ownership | Runtime vs package task archives pending | pending |
+| Independent Chinese Kit card | Verified directory and localization category pending | pending |
+| Unified official/third-party cards | Generic manifest-driven model/rendering pending | pending |
+| Language Kit slots / gray absent fields | Typed card slots pending | pending |
+| Restricted nonlanguage fields | Inert declarative fields/actions pending | pending |
+| Card tags and schema | Optional versioned card metadata, old generic fallback pending | pending |
+| Specifications and SDK | Update actual API/schema/examples after implementation | pending |
+| Languages search | Cached runtime metadata filter + actual Android UI test pending | pending |
+| Packages search | Catalog/local imported metadata filter + UI test pending | pending |
+| Chinese switch/persistence | Preserve 732 keys/id; add 1.0.1 catalog bindings; Android test pending | pending |
+| Preserve files/projects/packages/environment | Old delivery hashes, real upgrade fixtures, no data resets | pending |
+| Android startup | Preserve literal placeholder parser; Android16 fresh/upgrade/cold starts pending | pending |
+
+## Remaining implementation sequence
+
+1. Finish real Ubuntu task/LSP/DAP integration, including no-project, Chinese/space/colon paths, repeated runs and stop cleanup. Update Java LSP verifyCommand so Maven/Java Debug do not gate JDT installation; version/arch-specific config cache, optional debug bundle handling. clangd initialization fallback include flag uses literal `${workspaceRoot}` expansion (implemented generically in LspSession). Do not auto-execute unreviewed CMake on opening a file. Retain Python/DAP behavior.
+2. Add optional validated manifest `card` version1 categories (`language-ide-kit`, `localization`, `development-tool`, `utility`, `general`) with host-owned language slots and bounded inert text/link fields + references to declared actions. Old packages without card => generic. Tags never affect trust/grants/boundaries. `.suic` must not become advanced IDE/UI carrier. Add requirements `dependsOn` DAG and optional module checks; compute component closure; runtime requirements read-only in Kit plans.
+3. NativeKitSetup selection/review/install must only deploy selected IDE components, skip validated installed tools, verify after deployment, archive owned logs, retain partial state. Zero selected tools / localization must work without Ubuntu. JDK/GCC/Python download belongs only in Languages. Split Java's bundled installer and C++/Python grouped requirements so partial selection is real.
+4. Rewrite Languages with runtime-only discovery, reusable existing environment pages, pinned search; no Kit/LSP/DAP/log duplication. Rewrite Packages with one renderer for catalog + local/third-party cards, detailed component state/restart/logs, source trust, permissions, lifecycle, pinned local search. Surface Chinese independent card through signed catalog entry explicitly allowing unsigned package provenance; do not falsely mark its package official.
+5. Generate updated official Kits using existing matching key; keep old delivered files. Update Chinese package with same ID (new 1.0.1 file, preserve 1.0.0 file/732 values), all added host UI keys translated. Extend Core4 schemas/specifications/SDK/templates/examples + malicious-boundary tests. Update build_official.py generator (currently regenerates manifests at1.1.0/API3, hardcodes old branch URL).
+6. Version0.5.4/code1070807, one ARM64 debug APK, old signer/icons. Full JVM/Ubuntu/Android16 upgrade/fresh + real search/lifecycle/third-party card UI regressions. Source commits/clean workspace, artifact upload + roundtrip byte checks, public report with all25 items, exact hashes/links, distinguish Linux x64/Android native bridge from untested ARM64 tablet.
+
+## Authorized icon addition
+
+User superseded the old no-icon-change requirement. Import the exact SVG from `sui-code/user-icon-asset:design/user-assets/sui-code-app-icon.svg`, preserve S., side symbols, gradients and proportions; background #151922; mechanically split adaptive foreground/background; all launcher channels. This is lower priority than all P0 work. No extra interim APK; resource compilation and actual launcher/adaptive/small-size checks required. Current import SHA256: `39003c5686cdeaf2e09d018c17787f883667815d43227a8dd38b9b54634a60c3`. All previous functional requirements remain.
